                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sp(n)Sp(1)
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quotient+group"} quotient group
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+product+group"} direct product group
            of the given
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quaternion+unitary+groups"} quaternion unitary groups
            by their
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagonal"} diagonal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/center"} center
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+group+of+order+2"} cyclic group of order 2
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dimension"} dimension
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 4
