                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Spin(n_1) \cdot Spin(n_2)
            or just
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Spin
