                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sp(n).Sp(1)
              or just
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Sp
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
