                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9910100"} arXiv:hep-th/9910100
          %p
            As such these also appear as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/U-duality+groups"} U-duality groups
            and their
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subgroups"} subgroups
